//! The `bottom` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property participates in
//! setting the vertical position of a [positioned
//! element](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/position). This
//! `inset property` has no effect on non-positioned elements.
//!
//! Initial: auto. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: refer to the height of the containing block.
//!
//! Grammar: auto | <length-percentage> | <anchor()> | <anchor-size()>
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-position-3/#propdef-bottom
//!
